<h3>Mixed Elements in <code>App.tsx</code></h3>
<ol><li><b>Types & Interfaces:</b> <code>Product</code>, <code>HeroSlide</code>, <code>PromoBanner</code>, <code>FeaturedBlock</code>, <code>LookbookConfig</code>, <code>ProductReview</code>, <code>UserOrderItem</code>, <code>UserOrder</code>, <code>UserReturn</code> (all declared between L16 and L668).</li></ol>
<ol><li><b>Constants & Mock Data:</b> <code>SAMPLE_PRODUCTS</code>, <code>SAMPLE_REVIEWS</code>, <code>SAMPLE_HERO_SLIDES</code>, <code>SAMPLE_PROMO_BANNERS</code>, <code>SAMPLE_FEATURED_BLOCKS</code>, <code>DEFAULT_LOOKBOOK</code>, <code>SAMPLE_USER_ORDERS</code>, <code>SAMPLE_USER_RETURNS</code>.</li></ol>
<ol><li><b>Hardcoded Coupon Rules:</b> Handled in <code>handleApplyCoupon</code> (L981–L995) for <code>DIWALI30</code>, <code>WELCOME10</code>, and <code>FESTIVE500</code>.</li></ol>
<ol><li><b>Helper Functions & Handlers:</b></li></ol>
<p>   - Touch/swipe listeners: <code>handleProductTouchStart/Move/End</code> (L877), <code>handleHeroTouchStart/Move/End</code> (L912).</p>
<p>   - Horizontal shelf scroller: <code>scrollProducts</code> (L939).</p>
<p>   - Cart actions: <code>addToCart</code> (L1098), <code>updateCartQuantity</code> (L954), <code>removeCartItem</code> (L966).</p>
<p>   - Coupon handling: <code>handleApplyCoupon</code> (L978), <code>handleRemoveCoupon</code> (L998).</p>
<p>   - Wishlist toggle: <code>toggleWishlist</code> (L1109).</p>
<p>   - Filter handling: <code>resetAllFilters</code> (L1089), <code>activeFilterCount</code> (L1133).</p>
