<p>  * Item removal removes item from bag.</p>
<p>  * Quick-apply coupon pill or typing <code>DIWALI30</code> applies 30% discount; <code>FESTIVE500</code> applies ₹500 flat discount.</p>
<p>  * Free shipping threshold banner updates accurately.</p>
<ul><li>[ ] <b>Checkout Wizard:</b></li></ul>
<p>  * Stepper transitions: Step 1 (Address) -> Step 2 (Delivery speed) -> Step 3 (Payment mode) -> Step 4 (Confirmation).</p>
<p>  * Payment mode selector (UPI, Card, NetBanking, COD) reveals respective inputs.</p>
<p>  * Completing order generates order ID and downloadable text invoice.</p>
<ul><li>[ ] <b>Account Dashboard:</b></li></ul>
<p>  * Switch between Profile, Orders, and Returns tabs.</p>
<p>  * "Edit Profile" saves updated details in state.</p>
<p>  * "Track Order" opens timeline modal.</p>
